{"4790730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Faith | God's Lost Will", "steam_appid": 4790730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago The Neom began their global domination of The Overworld. nearly defeating The Old Clan before the cries of mortal man finally reached their god's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They where granted divine intervention by their faith that saved them from their enemy, but also plagued The Overworld for all those who tried to set claim onto it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This divine Holy Spirit cleansed The Overworld with the sins of man, setting forth a decade of ruin for all those in it's wake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Old Clan sealed The Holy Spirit's sins of humanity away long ago into seven vessels to postpone the eradication of life on The Overworld, but these vessels where only as immortal as they where made to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seals are fading and The Overworld is threatened by ruin once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the vessels, release the sins and bring forth an end to The Holy Spirits  destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore The Overworld, defeat monsters, mine for resources, craft new tools, build structures and create new machinery to automate your progression! Or you can take it slow by fishing and decorating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >all these things are only a small part of your adventure to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faith is a sandbox game made for those who want a lot of options in a video game. It's not just a single straight forward narrative like other action games, but it can be so if you chose.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago The Neom began their global domination of The Overworld. nearly defeating The Old Clan before the cries of mortal man finally reached their god's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They where granted divine intervention by their faith that saved them from their enemy, but also plagued The Overworld for all those who tried to set claim onto it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This divine Holy Spirit cleansed The Overworld with the sins of man, setting forth a decade of ruin for all those in it's wake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Old Clan sealed The Holy Spirit's sins of humanity away long ago into seven vessels to postpone the eradication of life on The Overworld, but these vessels where only as immortal as they where made to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seals are fading and The Overworld is threatened by ruin once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the vessels, release the sins and bring forth an end to The Holy Spirits  destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore The Overworld, defeat monsters, mine for resources, craft new tools, build structures and create new machinery to automate your progression! Or you can take it slow by fishing and decorating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >all these things are only a small part of your adventure to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faith is a sandbox game made for those who want a lot of options in a video game. It's not just a single straight forward narrative like other action games, but it can be so if you chose.</p>", "short_description": "Faith is a sandbox survival game with many different big and small mechanics built into it. Not only is it a lightweight video game, but it also has the experiences and mechanics that makes any game fun to play. It uses concepts from many popular video games like Minecraft and Terraria among others.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "he